This is much more aligned with SecCraft than decorative animation.

8. Syntax highlighting

This should be a priority.

For a pentesting academy, code/commands are first-class content.

Consider:

Shiki
Prism
Refractor
highlight.js

Shiki in particular can produce very polished code rendering.

You could support:

nmap -sV -sC 192.168.1.10
GET /api/v1/users HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJ...
{
  "role": "admin",
  "user_id": 1337
}

with proper language-aware highlighting and copy/run/test controls.

